# Stakeholders & Requirements Elicitation
## Scenario
-Scenario B — College Student Support Appointment System

## 1. Stakeholders

| Stakeholder              | Role                    | Direct User? | Needs / Concerns                           |
| ------------------------ | ----------------------- | ------------ | ------------------------------------------ |
| Student                  | Books appointments      | Yes          | Needs suitable appointment times           |
| Support Advisor          | Provides support        | Yes          | Needs appointment details                  |
| Support Administrator    | Manages appointments    | Yes          | Needs to manage bookings and cancellations |
| Student Services Manager | Manages support service | No           | Needs the service to be managed properly   |
| IT Staff                 | Maintains the system    | Yes          | Needs the system to work properly          |
| Data Protection Officer  | Protects student data   | No           | Needs student data kept safe               |

