## 4. Questions
1. How are appointments currently arranged?
2. What problems do students have when booking?
3. What happens if a student cancels or misses an appointment?
4. What information is needed to make an appointment?
5. Are there restrictions on who can book certain appointments?

## 5. Interview Notes
#Stakeholder: Support Administrator:
. Students currently contact support to arrange appointments.
. Students can have trouble finding suitable times.
. Cancellations and missed appointments need to be recorded.
. Student name, ID, contact details, date and time may be needed.
. Some appointments may have booking restrictions.

# 6. What I Learne
# Three things learned
1. Students need to see available appointment times.
2. Cancellations and missed appointments need to be recorded.
3. Some appointments may have booking restrictions.

